# Wiki-derived data. Both are fetched at setup rather than committed, which
# keeps this repository free of third party content entirely. See ATTRIBUTION.md
# for why that matters: the tiles are Jagex artwork that Weird Gloop is
# permitted to serve (a permission that is not transitive), and wiki text is
# CC BY-NC-SA 3.0, whose NonCommercial clause is not open source compatible.
#
# Keeping them out means the code here can carry a clean licence.
public/tiles/
public/labels.json

*.local
.DS_Store

